ref=\"/wiki/Mohanad_Jeahze\" title=\"Mohanad Jeahze\">Mohanad Jeahze</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby IF</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Patrik_W%C3%A5lemark\" title=\"Patrik Wålemark\">Patrik Wålemark</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Per_Frick\" title=\"Per Frick\">Per Frick</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_Larsson\" title=\"Sebastian Larsson\">Sebastian Larsson</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tobias_Sana\" title=\"Tobias Sana\">Tobias Sana</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Hattricks\">Hattricks</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2021&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Hattricks\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2021&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Hattricks\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>I nedanstående lista avses med <a href=\"/wiki/Hattrick\" title=\"Hattrick\">hattrick</a> att en spelare har gjort tre mål under samma match.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Spelare\n</th>\n<th>För\n</th>\n<th>Mot\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Resultat\n</th>\n<th>Datum\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Jamaica\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Jamaica\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Flag_of_Jamaica.svg/40px-Flag_of_Jamaica.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Flag_of_Jamaica.svg/60px-Flag_of_Jamaica.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blair_Turgott\" title=\"Blair Turgott\">Blair Turgott</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96stersunds_FK\" title=\"Östersunds FK\">Östersunds FK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro SK</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/ostersund-orebro-allsvenskan-herrar/4737971/\">5–0</a>\n</td>\n<td>18 april 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Edvardsen\" title=\"Victor Edvardsen\">Victor Edvardsen</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro SK</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/livescore/#?date=2021-05-18&amp;game=4738004\">3–0</a>\n</td>\n<td>18 maj 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Jamaica\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Jamaica\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Flag_of_Jamaica.svg/40px-Flag_of_Jamaica.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Flag_of_Jamaica.svg/60px-Flag_of_Jamaica.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blair_Turgott\" title=\"Blair Turgott\">Blair Turgott</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96stersunds_FK\" title=\"Östersunds FK\">Östersunds FK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/ostersund-if-elfsborg-allsvenskan-herrar/4738107/\">3–1</a>\n</td>\n<td>19 september 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Kosovo\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Kosovo\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Flag_of_Kosovo.svg/40px-Flag_of_Kosovo.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Flag_of_Kosovo.svg/60px-Flag_of_Kosovo.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"840\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astrit_Selmani\" title=\"Astrit Selmani\">Astrit Selmani</a><sup>4 mål</sup>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar FF</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/livescore/#?date=2021-12-04&amp;game=4738190\">5–3</a>\n</td>\n<td>4 december 2021\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Topphastighet,_löpmeter_och_antal_avslut\"><span id=\"Topphastighet.2C_l.C3.B6pmeter_och_antal_avslut\"></span>Topphastighet, löpmeter och antal avslut</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2021&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Topphastighet, löpmeter och antal avslut\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2021&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Topphastighet, löpmeter och antal avslut\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Efter avslutad säsong presenterade <a href=\"/wiki/Unibet\" title=\"Unibet\">Unibet</a> topplistor för topphastighet, antal löpmeter och antal avslut för individuella spelare.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-unibet&#95;54-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-unibet-54\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>54<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><table class=\"\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background:transparent; color:inherit; width:100%; font-size:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:33.33333333333%;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Topp-<br />hastighet\n</th>\n<th valign=\"bottom\">Spelare\n</th>\n<th valign=\"bottom\">Lag\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">34,24 km/h\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amin_Sarr\" title=\"Amin Sarr\">Amin Sarr</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mj%C3%A4llby_AIF\" title=\"Mjällby AIF\">Mjällby</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">34,06 km/h\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flaggbild\" title=\"Sverige\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content